        "TileImage": "$($repository 856b2aa2-e224-48c3-b890-01fdf4dba6de).Image",
        "Description": "A suburban town has been quietly overtaken by a dangerous cult that will stop at nothing to infiltrate local politics in preparation for an anticipated End of Days.  They have already poisoned and otherwised murdered several local residents who complained of their aggressive and coordinated tactics at town meetings.  Now they seek more power.\r\rIt&apos;s time to end this mencace before it grows any larger.\r\rEliminate the heads of the cult, the head of security and the candidate.  \r\rGood Luck, 47.",
